      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve filed b/149987779 to track fixing the external projects. It doesn\u0027t look like much work, but there\u0027s a lot of gerrit overhead to do it all at once. Also, since this change touches so many files I end up having to rebase and fix conflicts a lot, so I think it will be easier to land this first if the change is acceptable.",
